{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learning key layouts isn\u2019t just about typing games!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the keyboard while having fun in Key Riot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rebellious \u201cRiot Keys\u201d are running wild all over the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag and drop them back to their original positions with your mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster you restore them all, the higher your rank\u2014aim for the ultimate S Rank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stop the Riot with Typing Skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressing the correct key stops the matching Riot Key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit \u201cA\u201d and the \u201cA\u201d key freezes\u2014while shouting a clear \u201cOuch!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your typing skills to calm the chaos as fast as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beware of Super Riots</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you hit the keys too many times, a Super Riot begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a limited time, no matter how much you type, they won\u2019t stop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They\u2019ll Try to Escape Again!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even after restoring them, Riot Keys may escape with a certain probability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They\u2019ll shake their bodies as a warning\u2014type to stop them before they run off again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Key Layouts to Discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QWERTY / AZERTY / QWERTZ / DVORAK</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new keyboard layouts and memorize them naturally as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even read simple explanations in the built-in Key Encyclopedia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Achievements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn achievements by getting S Ranks, suppressing riots without typing, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete them all to view special artwork drawn by a professional artist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Other illustrations were drawn by the creator, Makimura.)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4113090?t=1762479784","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/dd0c4094adbcb0cf55a9da9faf431ad13ff05612/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762479784","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/c4557e4b45cf228eb3b61208408eed2a86d7455b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762479784","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/c4557e4b45cf228eb3b61208408eed2a86d7455b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762479784","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learning key layouts isn\u2019t just about typing games!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the keyboard while having fun in Key Riot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rebellious \u201cRiot Keys\u201d are running wild all over the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag and drop them back to their original positions with your mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster you restore them all, the higher your rank\u2014aim for the ultimate S Rank!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stop the Riot with Typing Skills</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pressing the correct key stops the matching Riot Key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit \u201cA\u201d and the \u201cA\u201d key freezes\u2014while shouting a clear \u201cOuch!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your typing skills to calm the chaos as fast as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beware of Super Riots</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you hit the keys too many times, a Super Riot begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For a limited time, no matter how much you type, they won\u2019t stop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They\u2019ll Try to Escape Again!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even after restoring them, Riot Keys may escape with a certain probability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They\u2019ll shake their bodies as a warning\u2014type to stop them before they run off again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Key Layouts to Discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QWERTY / AZERTY / QWERTZ / DVORAK</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new keyboard layouts and memorize them naturally as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even read simple explanations in the built-in Key Encyclopedia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Achievements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn achievements by getting S Ranks, suppressing riots without typing, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete them all to view special artwork drawn by a professional artist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Other illustrations were drawn by the creator, Makimura.)</p>","developers":["MAKIMURA"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4113090/b639d8ea1b1906c8a4e46299188c95c94eb353a1/header.jpg?t=1762479784","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4113090/2101244006/24b89a88423324dc10862eb89bc30f20bd7fc5f2/1761626407/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761909580","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store